WEBVTT

00:11:00.307 --> 00:11:04.855
Most US kids are going to meet
the N-word in class.

00:11:05.927 --> 00:11:09.728
One of the most assigned books
in US high schools

00:11:09.752 --> 00:11:12.347
is Mark Twain’s "The Adventures
of Huckleberry Finn"

00:11:12.371 --> 00:11:15.665
in which the word appears over 200 times.

00:11:16.023 --> 00:11:19.015
And this isn't an indictment
of "Huck Finn."

00:11:19.039 --> 00:11:22.641
The word is in lots
of US literature and history.

00:11:22.665 --> 00:11:25.990
It's all over African
American literature.

00:11:26.498 --> 00:11:28.593
Yet I hear from students

00:11:28.617 --> 00:11:33.038
that when the word is said during a lesson